@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor "Authenticated DMS user" as User
actor "Document owner" as Owner
actor "Accessible-document grantee / assignee" as Reader
actor "Django superuser" as Superuser

rectangle "APGC DMS — Memo workspace" {
  usecase "Sign in" as Login
  usecase "List visible Memos" as List
  usecase "Create Memo draft" as Create
  usecase "Edit own draft / returned Memo" as Edit
  usecase "Submit / resubmit own Memo" as Submit
  usecase "View accessible Memo details, versions and audit" as View
  usecase "View finalized/archived PDF" as Preview
  usecase "Download PDF / attachment" as Download
}
User --> Login
User --> List
User --> Create
Owner --> Edit
Owner --> Submit
Reader --> View
Reader --> Preview
Reader --> Download
Superuser --|> User
note right of Login
  Configured route uses Django Admin login.
  Account must be active, staff, and have
  usable credentials.
end note
note bottom of List
  Visibility is object-scoped: owner, active view grant,
  or assigned workflow task. Superuser does not bypass
  this Memo-workspace helper.
end note
note bottom of Download
  Owner, or access grant with both view and download.
  documents.download_document is not enforced here.
end note
note bottom of Submit
  Owner/state rules apply; a different eligible reviewer
  is selected. Submission binds an exact DocumentVersion.
end note
@enduml
